        "postDate": "2026-09-30T01:58:53.737Z",
        "rawMarkdown": "whats stopping someone from putting up a whole submission bloated with skills",
        "content": "<p>whats stopping someone from putting up a whole submission bloated with skills</p>",
        "replies": [
          {
            "id": 3530451,
            "postDate": "2026-09-30T07:53:16.997Z",
            "rawMarkdown": "Nothing stops it: the harness allows up to 1,000 skills, 50 MiB each, within the 3 GiB limit. That said, the ADK puts every skill's name and description into each model call, so a large library will eat through the 32k context window fast and trigger compaction sooner.",
